                             ===( Disclamer )===


  This program is Freeware... The author of this program is not responsible
       for the working of this program... Use it at your own risk...



                         ===( What's the use ? )===


      Well, I haven't seen a One Liner Wall for Tron BBS systems yet, so 
     here it is at last... Many people asked me to code a One Liner Wall,
            because, the Max's BBS versions aren't that good...


                            ===( Installation )===

     There are two programs included... The first one is the Wall itself,
 And must be copied to your doors dir... Make sure this directory is assigned!

           Just call it with:

                                     Clidoor "Doors:1Liner/1Liner ~51"


                   and the door will take care of the rest...

  The other program is a utility to clear the wall... Just copy it somewhere
     you like and start it from a cli... The wall will be cleared then...


